# Lullaby (Wiegenlied), Op. 49 No. 4 — Johannes Brahms, 1868 (public domain), tune simplified.
# Arranged by the Piano Practice contributors (MIT): the hands share the tune. Left hand in
# C position on middle C (C = 5 … G = 1), right hand from the G above (G = 1 … C = 4);
# both are written in the treble clef.
title: Lullaby (simplified)
composer: Johannes Brahms
arranger: Piano Practice contributors
time: 3/4
key: 0
tempo: 84
pickup: yes
license: Public domain (Brahms, 1868), arrangement MIT
